    <DataNode elementId="AT4G13260-MONOMER" textLabel="indole-3-pyruvate monooxygenase" type="Protein">
      <Xref identifier="Q9SVQ1" dataSource="uniprot" />
      <Graphics centerX="1050" centerY="515" width="90.0" height="25.0" textColor="000000" fontName="Arial" fontWeight="Normal" fontStyle="Normal" fontDecoration="Normal" fontStrikethru="Normal" fontSize="12" hAlign="Center" vAlign="Middle" borderColor="000000" borderStyle="Solid" borderWidth="1.0" fillColor="FFFFFF" shapeType="Rectangle" />
      <Comment source="pmngroup">YUCCA is a flavin monooxygenase-like protein. Plants over-expressing YUCCA have a typical phenotype of |FRAME: INDOLE_ACETATE_AUXIN indole-3-acetate| (IAA) response, and have increased level of IAA, suggesting that YUCCA is involved in IAA biosynthesis. Toxic tryptophan analog feeding of activation-tagged YUCCA plants further indicated that YUCCA is involved in converting tryptophan to IAA |CITS: [11209081]|. Previous work has found that the protein can convert |FRAME: TRYPTAMINE tryptamine| to N-hydroxyl tryptamine &lt;i&gt;in vitro&lt;/i&gt; and suggested that this is the primary role of this protein |CITS:[11209081]|. However, later research has shown that the main role of the enzyme is the monooxygenation of |FRAME: INDOLE_PYRUVATE indole-3-pyruvate|, forming |FRAME: INDOLE_ACETATE_AUXIN indole-3-acetate| directly |CITS: [22025724]|. The |FRAME: AT4G13260 YUC2| gene has been cloned and expressed in E. coli as a GST-fused protein. Purified GST-YUC2 actively converted IPA to IAA in an NADPH-dependent manner. Furthermore, |FRAME: TRYPTAMINE tryptamine| was not a substrate for the purified enzyme |CITS: [22025724 ]|.</Comment>
      <Property key="UniqueID" value="AT4G13260-MONOMER" />
      <Property key="AlternativeId_Araport" value="AT4G13260.1" />
      <Property key="AlternativeId_Smr" value="Q9SVQ1" />
      <Property key="AlternativeId_Prints" value="PR00469" />
      <Property key="AlternativeId_Pride" value="Q9SVQ1" />
      <Property key="AlternativeId_Interpro" value="IPR036188" />
      <Property key="AlternativeId_Pfam" value="PF00743" />
      <Property key="AlternativeId_Phylomedb" value="Q9SVQ1" />
      <Property key="AlternativeId_Uniprot" value="Q9SVQ1" />
      <Property key="Catalyzes" value="RXN-1824" />
      <Property key="Accession1" value="AT4G13260.1" />
      <Property key="Gene" value="AT4G13260" />
      <Property key="InstanceNameTemplate" value="MONOMER-*" />
      <Property key="MolecularWeightKd" value="46.543" />
      <Property key="MolecularWeightSeq" value="46.543" />
      <CitationRef elementRef="citation_PUB_11209081" />
      <CitationRef elementRef="citation_PUB_22025724" />
    </DataNode>
