      <Comment source="BioCyc">This reaction is different from the one described by the Nomenclature Committee of the International Union of Biochemistry and Molecular Biology (NC-IUBMB). The reaction is different in that two water molecules are used for each molecule of nitrile hydrolyzed. The NC-IUBMB reaction incorrectly lists a single water molecule.</Comment>
